cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below."
title: "Effect of a donor impurity on the optoelectronic properties of a linear quantum dot chain"
abstract: >-
  Finite-element simulations of a donor impurity inside a linear chain of five
  laterally coupled GaAs/AlGaAs quantum dots. The repository contains the raw
  COMSOL exports, the Python/Jupyter analysis and the final figures of the
  BSc Physics thesis.
authors:
